  "id": "walkthru-earth/indices",
  "title": "Walkthru-Indices",
  "description": "A suite of global planetary indices unifying building density, population projections (2025\u20132100), weather forecasts, and terrain metrics on an H3 hexagonal grid at multiple resolutions. Each index shares a common h3_index key enabling single-query cross-dataset joins. Source data includes GEDTM-30m elevation, Global Building Atlas (2.75 billion polygons), WorldPop SSP scenarios, and NOAA AI-NWP forecasts, stored as Parquet with ZSTD compression.",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
